## Supported diagram types

| Diagram type | merman | mermaid-rs-renderer |
|---|:---:|:---:|
| flowchart / graph | ✅ | ✅ |
| sequenceDiagram | ✅ | ✅ |
| classDiagram | ✅ | ✅ |
| stateDiagram | ✅ | ✅ |
| erDiagram | ✅ | ✅ |
| pie | ✅ | ✅ |
| gantt | ✅ | ✅ |
| timeline | ✅ | ✅ |
| mindmap | ✅ | ✅ |
| gitGraph | ✅ | ✅ |
| xychart | ✅ | ✅ |
| block diagram | ✅ | ❌ |
| architecture | ✅ | ❌ |
| kanban | ✅ | ❌ |
| c4diagram | ✅ | ❌ |
| sankey | ✅ | ❌ |
| packet | ✅ | ❌ |

